node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
.vscode/
coverage/
_site/
.release/
*.patch
# ── Documents are PRIVATE by default ───────────────────────────────────────
# Rule from the owner (@codinglombok): no document (*.md / *.MD — masterplan,
# architecture, SPEC, changelog_*, map_*, …) is committed or published without
# the owner's explicit approval. Everything is ignored; only documents the
# owner deliberately selected are re-included below. To publish a new doc,
# get owner approval first, then add a `!path` line here in the same PR.
*.md
*.MD
docs/*
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/DISTRIBUTION.md
!/ROADMAP.md
!/SECURITY.md
!/TESTING.md
!/.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md
!/docs/api.md
!/docs/architecture.md
!/docs/porting.md
!/docs/theming.md
!/templates/*/README.md
